# Your resume, in any form. Personal data, and this repo gets pushed.
# The character classes make it case-insensitive without relying on a
# case-insensitive filesystem: Resume.pdf, RESUME.PDF, my_resume_2026.docx,
# jane-doe-resume.txt and resume.md all match.
*[Rr][Ee][Ss][Uu][Mm][Ee]*

# ...except the test suite and its fixtures, which contain no real data and
# must stay in the repo.
!tests/test_resume.py
!tests/fixtures/resume_sample.pdf
!tests/fixtures/resume_scanned.pdf
